# This file is committed: NEVER put a real value in it.
#
# The Worker reads no .env file. Variables come from wrangler.jsonc (`vars`) and the --var flags that
# `npm run dev` and `npm run preview` pass; secrets are Cloudflare Worker secrets that each copy's owner sets with
# wrangler. Names and where they live: docs/SECRETS.md.
#
# Local development needs no secrets. To try one locally, put it in a git-ignored .dev.vars file.
